(7562850, 1212285, 114285, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> I used three exposures with this image. Edited with NIK analog, added a bit of texture, and just played around with other filters. To tell the truth I''ve forgotten a lot of what I''ve done because I edited it early on in the piece.<br/>Thanks anyway!</td>', ' posthumous I used three exposures with this image. Edited with NIK analog, added a bit of texture, and just played around with other filters. To tell the truth I''ve forgotten a lot of what I''ve done because I edited it early on in the piece.Thanks anyway!', '2018-03-15 22:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
